==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þurr|lang=non}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/θʏrː/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ʏrː|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|þurrari|þurrastur}}

# [[dry]]; without [[liquid]]
# [[dry]], [[alcohol-free]]; without [[alcohol]]
#: ''Þetta var '''þurr''' helgi.''
#:: It was an '''alcohol-free''' weekend.
#: ''Sádí-Arabía er '''þurt''' land.''
#:: Saudi Arabia is an '''alcohol-free''' country.

